  "summary_en": "Japanese ministerial ordinance setting technical standards for daily and periodic motor vehicle inspection, maintenance records and garages under the Road Transport Vehicle Act. Includes a provision requiring manufacturers to supply maintenance information, with capability checks for recipients of data on automated operation devices. Largely conventional vehicle mechanics.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Defines daily and periodic (3/12/24-month) inspection standards in appended tables by vehicle class",
   "Requires maintenance record keeping for one to two years",
   "Sets garage standards and required tools",
   "Manufacturers must provide type-specific technical maintenance information within six months of sale",
   "Information on automated operation devices may be restricted to recipients verified as capable of proper inspection"
  ],
